#: ../../develop/index.rst:2
msgid "OpenMV MicroPython Internals"
msgstr "Internals OpenMV MicroPython"

#: ../../develop/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"This chapter covers a tour of MicroPython from the perspective of a "
"developer, contributing to MicroPython. It acts as a comprehensive resource "
"on the implementation details of MicroPython for both novice and expert "
"contributors."
msgstr ""
"Bab ini mencakup tur MicroPython dari perspektif pengembang yang "
"berkontribusi pada MicroPython. Bab ini berfungsi sebagai sumber daya "
"komprehensif tentang detail implementasi MicroPython untuk kontributor "
"pemula maupun ahli."

#: ../../develop/index.rst:8
msgid ""
"Development around MicroPython usually involves modifying the core runtime, "
"porting or maintaining a new library. This guide describes in great depth "
"the implementation details of MicroPython including a getting started guide,"
" compiler internals, porting MicroPython to a new platform and implementing "
"a core MicroPython library."
msgstr ""
"Pengembangan seputar MicroPython biasanya melibatkan modifikasi runtime "
"inti, porting atau pemeliharaan pustaka baru. Panduan ini menjelaskan secara"
" mendalam detail implementasi MicroPython termasuk panduan memulai, internal"
" compiler, porting MicroPython ke platform baru dan mengimplementasikan "
"pustaka inti MicroPython."
